menu "USB CDC"
    depends on TINYUSB_CDC_ENABLED

    config USB_CDC_SERIAL_STRING
        string "Serial number string"
        default "000001"
        help
            Fixed USB serial number string. The same serial number on all devices
            makes Windows assign them the same COM port number.
            Leave empty to use the esp_tinyusb default (since esp_tinyusb 3.0 it is
            derived from the eFuse base MAC, so every device gets its own COM port).

endmenu
